## Fix Sanity Checks click for orphaned attributes (DC-W03)

Context: Clicking a Sanity Checks warning such as ``paymentmethod`` / "Property has no domain" opened Ontology → Relationships, where the item does not exist. Root cause: the finding was a DatatypeProperty (attribute), tagged ``kind: property``. Relationships only lists ObjectProperties, so the link looked dead.

